[{"id":167837099,"discussion_id":"0fc6b84f97eed41c0f499c77b4b0dd0b3432e5c5","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| conv | ✅ [*lileizheng*](https://gitcode.com/lileizheng), [*陈琦*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*lileizheng*](https://gitcode.com/lileizheng), [*陈琦*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n hongyiliu111, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-09T19:43:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-20T17:15:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167837148,"discussion_id":"cecbaf716764b7296bbeecd0d62855d2b609c387","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复3D卷积反向传播（输入梯度计算）内核中，在特定配置下计算有效输出高度（Hp）时，下侧填充（backpropPadDown）值可能超过硬件指令限制（255）导致计算错误的问题。该问题会影响卷积反向传播计算的正确性，可能导致模型训练或推理结果异常。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了 `UpdateL1ComputeInfo` 函数中计算有效输出高度 `Hp` 的逻辑。将原先直接使用固定值255作为下侧填充，改为根据 `tiling_->backpropPadDown` 的实际值进行动态判断：如果该值大于255，则使用其真实值；否则，使用255。这确保了在 `load3d` 指令的 `padList[3]` 固定为255的硬件约束下，`Hp` 的计算公式能够正确反映实际的填充情况，从而计算出正确的有效输出区域大小，保证后续卷积计算的正确性。","created_at":"2026-04-09T19:44:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-09T19:44:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168631808,"discussion_id":"3bae78916b4684626f25b09b5c69c45ff2a086e1","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-04-17T11:24:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-17T11:24:25+08:00","user":{"id":"68d2070ae9c5fa79629530b4","login":"hongyiliu111","object_id":"68d2070ae9c5fa79629530b4","name":"hongyiliu111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hongyiliu111"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168632029,"discussion_id":"bfeb64fff9a2f83efe38d401fe993e629fcaa162","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=6d1a03b8901c45e5b8eb9c27f1de7f07&projectName=CANN'>6d1a03b8901c45e5b8eb9c27f1de7f07</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86_ubuntu24</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=6d1a03b8901c45e5b8eb9c27f1de7f07&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascen